  "description": "Makiko has hit hard times. After being kicked out of home by her mother, Makiko makes her way by selling her services, and she pays the rent with her body. Every single penny she earns is to get out of her two-bit town and start a new life. Can her shady dealings lead to a better life?\n\nThe Yamaguchi Academy is a private all-girls boarding school that resides on it's own private island. The academy has no tuition fee, but the students have to pay in a different way.\n\nShady Dealings by GY is Fakku Books’ first original title. Cute kogals, alternative goth girls and oddly sweet story elements with some slightly darker tinges are some of the components that readers will discover from the German based creator.\n\nSource: https://www.fakku.net/hentai/shady-dealings-english-1513826520",
